<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EST" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc1">Esther</para>
  <para style="toc2">Esther</para>
  <para style="mt1">Esther</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai, now arui khin dow 468-424 BC takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Filistin pren kowi kowplan hanow kawmkratma hown nathawp Jerusalem tap kown nau dowi kowi Persia pren kowi asowrma uowi kown mih nau mih Israeluüa lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Esther bowih dow akeng bowih iawng nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Esther bowih kowi dow pakatchow khowm Thurai ming rükla dowi chekhai. Tawkche mami bowih kowi lang pe kür mih dow aia maru-uüa kowi Thurai mingkhetah mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Esther bowih kowi kowh lawnguan phaw mih dow Ezra bowih taruk hai ranit lawng kowi kowh lawnguan phaw mih khin khe chekhai. Esther dow Jihudi chenchap saratchow chah chekhai. Tawkche aia dow chowng Persia mangma khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Esther kowh sakkraingra hai aia chenchapuüa kowi sakrau mih rakowi ransu-uüa rut kowi kowng kown mih hownia Jihudiuüa mih ka lawngra khai. Nami hownia mami bowih ming dow Esther pahai towah khai. Nami klen kowi Jihudi chenchap kowh pawi kri Purim pami uang phawla mih hai auan paw mami bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Purim pawi: Purim pawi pami dow Esther chowng mangma mih khin khe Persia pren kowi kowh Jihudiuüa mih ransu-uüa rut kowi nakowng kown mih ni khe ka plaira hanow apiaw apama ka sun khai rakowi natukla reng kownkow sunah mih pawi ni chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Akletia: Akletia pami dow alai kowh manguüa mih amatni kowh kim chawng mih hai kim kowi nape chang lup kownkow kletah mih maru kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai. Naiawng kletah mih dow manguüa mih amatni kowh masi hown hang pacham nowng chang iang lah pakowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Khang hawm: Khang hawm pami dow kowmatia vüi chepaw maru vüi chepaw nakala iungra kownkow kham hawm sakkrai khükhü Thurai tut-e lüleng mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang Ahasuer thak pawi mih hai Vasti plawta mangma rah mih 1:1-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Esther ka mangma rah mih 2:1-23</para>
  <para style="io1">Mawrdekai hai Jihudiuüa kowi piakta kown Haman sangkrang mih 3:1-15</para>
  <para style="io1">Esther tut-e Mawrdekai lü khowng mih 4:1-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang tut-e aia kükah mih Esther ka mih 5:1-7:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Haman sum mih hai Jihudiuüa ka lawngra mih 8:1-9:16</para>
  <para style="io1">Purim pawi 9:17-32</para>
  <para style="io1">Mawrdekai ka iukra mih 10:1-3</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EST 1" />
  <para style="s">Mang Ahasuer thak pawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="EST 1:1-2" />Mami phaw mih dow Persia pren kowi kowh Susa marow kri kowi Ahasuer chowm mang khe chekhai. Aia kruitownah mih Persia pren kowi pren powng uowi mih dow 127 klüng chekhai. Naiawngün pren powng dow India pren sünghi hownia Ethiawpia pren sünghi mowr chekhai. <verse eid="EST 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 1:3" />Aia chowm mang mih sum ning khe aia dow aia kowh maru iukuüa hai aluchowuüa maten vüi chang pe pawi lowk khai. Nami pawi nauang tawi sun kownkow pren powng maten kowi kowh ringkaw uowima mih maru-uüa hai maru iukuüa, now Persia pren hai Media pren kowi kowh siphai aluchowuüa kowi aia hawla khai. <verse eid="EST 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 1:4" />Aia dow nami pawi mih 180 ni mowr thakah khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan hu mih hai aia kowh mangra kri kraing mih pinsüauüa kowi tüng pe khai.<verse eid="EST 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 1:5" />Nami pawi chur mih auai ni khe aia dow Susa marow kri kowi kowh aiuk asowm bowkbowk vüi plan thak pawi ranit ni khai iawk. Nami leng dow aia kowh bakan talang kowi aia chang pawi khai. <verse eid="EST 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 1:6" />Nami bakan talang dow akawchow mih uaniang hai aruachow mih uaniang hown aia krawi tawngah khai. Naiawngün uaniang tük müa dow asung khakma mih hua hown thawp pe achüng hanow tai hown kowh thawpah mih akli krawi chawp pe khai. Now uaniang dow naiawngün akli kowi akaw hai aruama panow adipükchow mih la hown kowh leng hown krawi tükah khai. Nami talang dow akawma, aringma, asingma hai anumma mih hua asung khakma mih hown phaiah khai, now nami luk kowi dow kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih chowm rah krawi tow pe khai. <verse eid="EST 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 1:7" />Pinsüauüa khamla grep tui mih bia maten dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih kangowh chekhai. Naiawngün bia dow lowk paw apowm tatu dowi chekhai. Mang dow aia kowh saktuak iung mih natüngla kownkow amatni kowi grep tui ahuma peah khai. <verse eid="EST 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 1:8" />Pinsüauüa dow nowng kham mowr chi kham grep tui büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow pinsüauüa nau mowr chi napeah kown mih anaruüa kowi mangkri tek pe khai.<verse eid="EST 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 1:9" />Nami khin khe masiuüa mang Vasti paw masiuüa hawmh vüi mang Ahasuer kim kowi chang pe pawi lowk khai.<verse eid="EST 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masiuüa mang Vasti plawta mangra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 1:10" />Now pawi chur ni ranit ni mih ni khe dow mang Ahasuer mih kham grep tui kowh pua se piaw khai. Nakhowk khe aia dow anar Mehuman, Biztha, Harbona, Bigtha, Abagtha, Zethar hai Karkas büah kowi hawah khai. <verse eid="EST 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 1:11" />Now mang lukruk krukma hown Vasti kowi nauang pawla kownkow naiawngün nar ranit ia kowi aia tek pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow maru kawmuüa hai maru iukuüa kowi aia kowh masi lainowmma klangiung mih natüng pe kown nau kowh chekhai. <verse eid="EST 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 1:12" />Now mang kowh naruüa dow Vasti kowi mih mang kowh ana kowtek pe khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow mang pur kowi kowkowi kown mih mapaw nau dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mang dow nowm nowm kunmarau khai.<verse eid="EST 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="EST 1:13-14" />Naiawng rakowi mang dow Persia pren hai Media pren kowi kowh prengia pek mih lang kri miuüa hown kowtalawp khai. Naiawngünuüa dow prengia uowima kangowh, now Persia pren kowi kowh ari aiang hai ari arow ün atukma kangowh chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mang dow aia nau changah kown mih lup lawnguan kowi amatni tut-e paw prengia reng chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Karsena, Sethar, Admatha, Tarsis, Meres, Marsena hai Memukan büah chekhai.<verse eid="EST 1:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 1:15" />Amatni kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Masiuüa mang Vasti kowi nauang pawla kownkow ang kowh naruüa kowi ang peah ana chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Vasti mih ang kowh ana pek chün dowi chekhai. Naiawng mih maru kowi naripah kown mih lawnguan ari aiang kowi tawng iawng chow uowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 1:16" />Nakhowk khe mang hai lang kri mih maru iukuüa pur kowi Memukan tek mih, “Masiuüa mang Vasti peah rukrai mih dow mang lowk iachow kowi nadowi; nami dow mangkri kowh maru iukuüa maten kowi hai pren powng kowi kowh maru maten kowi pe rukrai mih chekhai. <verse eid="EST 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 1:17" />Vasti lawnguan dow masiuüa maten pungmadawng kowi nakrawi tauet kown chekhai, now amatni kowh hua kowi khareah se natek kown mih, ‘Aia pur kowi nauang kownkow amasi Vasti kowi mang Ahasuer peah ana mih kowi khowm padow Vasti kowkowi pe dowi mih en tuk dowi bow?’ napa kown chekhai. <verse eid="EST 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 1:18" />Nami masiuüa mang kowh lawnguan tata hanow Persia pren hai Media pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowh masi hawmh dow amatni huauüa laiklow nachün kown nadowi bowt. Amatni dow huauüa kowi naring nakaw kown nadowi bowt, now huauüa mih amatni kowh masiuüa kowi nakunmarauah kown towbowt.<verse eid="EST 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 1:19" />“Mangkri, en che nauta hanow en pur kowi mang Vasti katpaw nowng uangla dowi bowt kown mih ana lawt lowk diah. Now nami ana dow katpaw nowng klowi dowi bowt kownkow Persia hai Media pren ari aiang bowih kowi pacham ruiah lah. Now mang Vasti lak-e lang iung mih masiuüa lowk ia kowi pe chowmah mang diah. <verse eid="EST 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 1:20" />En kowh nami ana pek mih en pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi krawi phuang hanow iawngpa mih masiuüa hai ringkaw uowima mih masiuüa mih amatni huauüa kowi naringkaw kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 1:21" />Memukan kowh prengia dow mang hai maru iukuüa mih nauta bowk khai. Naiawng rakowi mang dow Memukan tek iawng chang lup khai. <verse eid="EST 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 1:22" />Aia dow chowlowkkow kim kowi kachakuüa nachowng kim iah kown mih hai kachakuüa tek iawng kimchakuüa nachün kown mih lawnguan aia pren kowi kowh arah towng kowi krawi sak cha khai. Naiawng aia krawi sak cha mih dow arah towng kowi kowh chowlowkkow maru-uüa kowh cha hai chowlowkkow chenchap lai hown chekhai.<verse eid="EST 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EST 2" />
  <para style="s">Esther chowng masiuüa mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 2:1" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowh kunmarau prowng kung kowi dow mang Ahasuer mih amasi Vasti changta mih lup hai aia vüi kowi kowh lawtta ana mih lawnguan kowi tatuak khai. <verse eid="EST 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 2:2" />Nakhowk khe mang kowi aia kowh maru iukuüa tek pe mih, “Mangkri, en vüi malauüa klangiungma mih nakrawi cham kownkow pe ana diah. <verse eid="EST 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 2:3" />En pren kowi kowh pren powng maten kowi tow pe maru iuk diah. Naiawngün maru iukuüa mih malauüa klangiungma mih maten pakrawi cham en lah, now Susa marow kri kowi kowh en kim kowi kowh masiuüa nungra kowi pauang sa büah lah. Now nakowi kowh masiuüa nungra mingkhet mih <char style="w">akletia</char> Hegai mih naiawngün malauüa hawmh kowi pacham mingkhet lah. Now naiawngün malauüa hawmh naklangiungla ngamlam kownkow tatawng müa chap maten Hegai pacham peah lah. <verse eid="EST 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 2:4" />Nami kung kowi dow mangkri nauah mih masiuüa kowi Vasti takcha napeah masiuüa mangra kown,” pakhai. Naiawng aia kowh maru iukuüa peah prengia mih dow mangkri mih lainowmma awmrawm khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami powm iawng chang khai bowt.<verse eid="EST 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 2:5" />Nami khin khe Jihudi chenchap Benjamin krungchak Mawrdekai dow Susa marow kri kowi uowi khai. Aia dow Jair kowh chapa chekhai, Jair dow Simei kowh chapa, now Simei dow Kis kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="EST 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 2:6" />Juda pren kowi Jehoiakin chowm mang khe mang Nebuknezar mih Jerusalem marow hownia mang hailawm maru sangrum kowi khümla hanow Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi Mawrdekai kowh pipu-uüa paw tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 2:7" />Mawrdekai kowh dow apahi kowh chama Hadasa pami uowi lowk ia. Hadasa kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Esther chekhai. Aia dow kowru hai apowm klangiungma chekhai. Tawkche aia kowh dow a-u a-pa kowng bowk rakowi arak Mawrdekai mih achama iawng ta thum ta mawmah khai.<verse eid="EST 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 2:8" />Mang lawtta ana kung kowi dow malauüa akawmma kowi Susa marow kri kowi kowh mang kim kowi kowh masiuüa nungra kowi uang pawla khai. Nakhowk khe Esther kowi paw masiuüa nungra kowi uang pawla khai. Now naiawngün malauüa hawmh kowi dow Hegai kowi pe mingkhetah khai. <verse eid="EST 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 2:9" />Hegai dow Esther luk kowi lainowmma sak-ih rakowi aia kowi klangiungma klowpah klangah reng chekhai. Aia kowi dow uang uown uowi hownia naklangiungla ngamlam kownkow tatawng müa uanh hai chakkham lang iung mih Hegai peah khai. Aia vüi dow mang kim hownia ruiah mih narma Hegai tow pe ranit ia khai, now aia hai aia kowh narmauüa kowi dow mang kim kowi kowh masiuüa nungra kowi kowh lang iung mih towklak kowi towah khai.<verse eid="EST 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 2:10" />Esther dow aia kowh chen hai krungchak ming mia tut-e paw tek dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow apama kowh chapa Mawrdekai mih pe tekah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 2:11" />Now Esther iung reng tak chow mih hai tawng chow own mih own dowi mih natukla kownkow Mawrdekai dow ni towng mang kim kowi kowh masiuüa nungra kim viadawng kowi kowlen reng chekhai. <verse eid="EST 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 2:12" />Mang Ahasuer tut-e kowkowi kown mih masiuüa maten dow kowkowi kown mih akhin uang ting dowi rawn paning mowr naklangiungla ngamlam kownkow achang takla mih maten chang reng chekhai. Amatni dow taruk la mowr sau nam iungma mih hai taruk la mowr paingbawng hai tatawng müa uanh hown tatawng reng chekhai. <verse eid="EST 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 2:13" />Mang tut-e lowra mih masiuüa kowkowi mih khin khe dow mang kim kowi kowh masiuüa nungra hownia aia nauah mih tawnguat hai tatawng müa uanh hown ia tatawngla chekhai. <verse eid="EST 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 2:14" />Nami masiuüa dow uariiu khe mang tut-e kowkowi hanow auai rau uarthowi khe dow mang hown kowh ki taphua taiua mih masiuüa uowi rah kowi kowuowi reng chekhai. Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh dow mang sak-ih kowh rük pe ming khükhü hawah dowi bowt hanow mang tut-e kowka kowi dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawngün masiuüa hawmh kowh mingkhet mih dow akletia Sasgaz chekhai.<verse eid="EST 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 2:15" />Now Mawrdekai changla chama mih apahi Abihail chama Esther kowh paw mang tut-e kowkowi khin uang ting khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Esther dow aia kowh mingkhet mih akletia Hegai pe tatawngah mih klen kowi tawngpaw kük dowi bowt chekhai. Esther kowi dow khi mih maru maten naukhi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="EST 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 2:16" />Esther kowi mang kim kowi mang tut-e kowpawla mih dow mang Ahasuer chowm mang mih ranit ning kowi kowh hamüt la khe chekhai. Nami dow Tebet la khe chekhai.<verse eid="EST 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 2:17" />Esther kowi dow akeng mih masiuüa hawmh maten kowi lak-e mang lang sakrauah khai, now aia dow akeng mih malauüa hawmh maten lak-e mang tut-e saksing sanara hai sakraura lang ka khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow mang mih kruk pe mang lukruk lowk khai, now Vasti takcha kowi aia kowi dow peah masiuüa mangra khai. <verse eid="EST 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 2:18" />Nami kung kowi dow mang mih Esther kowi nakiowriah kownkow thak pawi kri lowk khai. Nami pawi kowi aia dow aia kowh maru iukuüa hai aluchowuüa maten kowi hawla khai. Now aia pren kowi kowh pren powng maten kowi nami ni mih lup chang tanai ni iawng hai nasunah kownkow aia krawi phuang khai, now awmrawmma hown maru kawmuüa kowi paw luah khai.<verse eid="EST 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang kowi saita kown mih sangkrangra Mawrdekai tata mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 2:19" />Akung kowi malauüa hawmh plan takua mih khin khe Mawrdekai kowi dow mang kim kowi kowh maru iuk lowk ia mih arah peah khai. <verse eid="EST 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 2:20" />Esther dow arak Mawrdekai tek pe iawng aia kowh chen ming hai aia kowh krungchak ming itah khai. Esther dow arak Mawrdekai thumah mawmah mih khin khe kowh chün lai mih iawng nami khin khe paw chün reng chekhai.<verse eid="EST 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 2:21" />Mang kim tapplawt kowi Mawrdekai chang lup mih khin khe akat dow mang kim tapplawt chawng mih akletia Bigthana hai akletia Teres iüah dow kunmarau kowh mang Ahasuer kowi kowngta kown mih sangkrang khai. <verse eid="EST 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 2:22" />Nami sangkrangra laiklow tata hanow Mawrdekai dow masiuüa mang Esther kowi phowk pe khai. Now naiawng Mawrdekai tek pe mih lawnguan dow mangkri kowi Esther phowk pe khai. <verse eid="EST 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 2:23" />Now nami lawnguan dow nowm bow dai bow pami natukla kownkow krawi chetah hanow anowm chekhai pami mang tukta khai. Naiawng rakowi nami pre ia kowi dow aia saita khai. Naiawngün laiklow maten dow Amat Müa Bowih kowi ruiah bowk khai.<verse eid="EST 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EST 3" />
  <para style="s">Jihudiuüa kowi napiakah kownkow Haman kowh sangkrangra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 3:1" />Naiawng phaw mih pre sum ning kung kowi mang Ahasuer dow aia kowh maru iukuüa maten luk kowi kowh lang iuk mih arah Haman kowi peah khai. Haman dow Agag krungchak Hamedatha kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="EST 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 3:2" />Haman kowi tua kung se nachupah kownkow mang mih aia kowh maru iukuüa maten kowi peah ana khai. Nachenganchepaw Mawrdekai dow kung paw tawi tua dowi, now chup paw tawi chup dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EST 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 3:3" />Nakhowk khe mang kowh maru iukuüa tek pe Mawrdekai mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow mang kowh ana pek en chün dowi?” pakhai. <verse eid="EST 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 3:4" />Nakhowk khe Mawrdekai klangah mih, “Ang dow Jihudi chenchap chekhai. Haman kowi ang ia chup dowi tham,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow Haman kowi nachup kown mih ni towng Mawrdekai kowi tek pe khai. Nachepaw Mawrdekai dow hawt sünta pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Mawrdekai kowi tawng iawng dow nachangah tak chünchü pakowh Haman kowi kowtek pe büah khai.<verse eid="EST 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 3:5" />Now tua kung se aia kowi Mawrdekai chupah dowi mih tukta hanow Haman dow lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="EST 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 3:6" />Nachenganchepaw Mawrdekai dow Jihudi chenchap taih pami aia tukta hanow Mawrdekai lowk iachow kowi saita kown mih sak-ih dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Persia pren kowi kowh Jihudiuüa maten kowi saita kown mih sangkrang khai.<verse eid="EST 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 3:7" />Naiawng rakowi Jihudiuüa kowi nasaita kown mih ni hai la natukla kownkow Ahasuer chowm mang mih laipre ning khe Nisan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nisan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">la dow la uown chekhai.</char></note> la kowi aia kowh prengia pek miuüa kowi Haman mih aia pur kowi pe kuakah plang khai. Now naiawng kuak plang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Plang </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow Persia lai hown “Pur” chekhai.</char></note> khe kowh plang cha mih dow Adar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Adar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">la dow laipre la chekhai.</char></note> la kowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 3:8" />Nami kung kowi mang Ahasuer kowi Haman tek pe mih, “En pren kowi kowh pren powng maten kowi chenchapuüa pungmadawng kowi krawi tauet mih chenchap uowi lowk. Amatni kowh ari aiang dow akeng chenchapuüa kowh ari aiang hown alangma chekhai, now mang kowh ari aiang paw amatni dow chün dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow towah sing kown mih mang vüi kowi iung dowi tham. <verse eid="EST 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 3:9" />Naiawng rakowi mangkri, en che nauta khai hanow kowbüah kowi nachumta kownkow lawt ana diah. Nahanow mangkri kowh lup chang müa vüi dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi tai 8,750 mawn ang nauang tow kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 3:10" />Nakhowk khe mang mih aia rut kowi kowh mur uowi mih rutbüt klüpah hanow Jihudiuüa kowh ransu Agag krungchak Hamedatha kowh chapa Haman kowi peah khai. <verse eid="EST 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 3:11" />Haman kowi mang tek pe mih, “Tawngpaw tangka apek lakke dowi. Nami chenchap luk kowi en tut-e iung iawng kowchang taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 3:12" />Nami kung kowi dow la uown kowi kowh lacher laisum ni mih ni khe Haman mih mang kowh cha rui miuüa kowi hawah khai. Nami cha rui miuüa dow Haman kowh ana pek iawng pren powng maten kowi chowlowkkow chenchap cha hai chowlowkkow chenchap lai hown ruiah khai. Now naiawngün chasak dow pren powng maten kowi kowh kruitown miuüa kowi hai chenchap aluchowuüa kowi nakrawi sa kownkow aia pe ana khai. Naiawngün chasak dow mang Ahasuer ming hown ruiah khai, now mang kowh mur uowi mih rutbüt hown tuk pe mur khai. <verse eid="EST 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 3:13" />Now naiawngün chasak dow mang Ahasuer pren kowi kowh pren powng maten kowi satang phowng miuüa kowi aia krawi pe saah khai. Nami chasak kowi ana pek uowi mih dow Adar la lacher laisum ni mih ni khe Jihudi maten kachakuüa, masiuüa, ngeuüa hai lawngtanguüa kowi asaima nasaita bowk kown mih lawnguan chekhai. Now amatni kowh dawngthawnguan paw narupta pe bowk kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="EST 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 3:14" />Nami ni khe Persia pren kowi kowh maru maten kamrütma hown naia uowila kownkow nami chasak kowi kowh ana pek pren powng maten kowi krawi phuangah khai.<verse eid="EST 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 3:15" />Now mang peta ana hanow satang phowng miuüa dow alenma lawt khai bowt, now nami chasak kowi kowh ana pek dow Susa marow kri kowi paw phuangla pe khai. Nami kung kowi mang hai Haman iüah dow taiua kham grep tui khai. Tawkche Susa marow kri kowi kowh maru-uüa dow nami satang tata hanow lainowmma tuak krat büah khai.<verse eid="EST 3:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EST 4" />
  <para style="s">Masiuüa mang Esther tut-e Mawrdekai lü khowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 4:1" />Naiawngün satang maten tata hanow Mawrdekai dow aia khupah mih tawnguat thekta now khup sala uan khai, now aia lu kowi prui plawi khai. Now marow prakowi mang se mang se atün atünma karla now kowkowi khai. <verse eid="EST 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 4:2" />Naiawng hai aia dow karla se mang kim tapplawt mowr kowkowi khai. Tawkche aia dow alak kowi kownowng kup dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow sala uan khupma hown alak kowi mia kowi paw pe kup dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 4:3" />Now mang kowh ana pek ting mih pren maten kowi kowh Jihudiuüa dow lainowmma taprüa khai, khang hawm khai, now kar hai nguk hown uowi büah khai. Tawngbak mih dow khup sala uan hanow plawi dawng kowi mawk khai.<verse eid="EST 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 4:4" />Akung kowi Esther kowh narmauüa hai akletiauüa mih Esther tut-e uangah hanow Mawrdekai lawnguan uang tek pe khai. Nami satang tata hanow Esther dow lainowmma sak kowi rau khai. Aia dow sala uan takcha kowi akhup müa tawnguat Mawrdekai kowi krawi sa pe khai. Nachenganchepaw Mawrdekai dow nami tawnguat hawt paw pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 4:5" />Nakhowk khe Esther dow akletia Hathak kowi hawah hanow Mawrdekai tut-e kowchinah khai. Now Mawrdekai tawng chow own mih hai tawngplawng kowchow naiawng own mih nakowlünta kownkow Hathak kowi aia peah ana khai.<verse eid="EST 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 4:6" />Nakhowk khe Hathak dow marow dawnglang kowi kowh mang kim tapplawt kowi Mawrdekai hown kowtakrum khai. <verse eid="EST 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 4:7" />Nahanow Mawrdekai dow aia luk kowi tawng ngai chow phaw mih hai Jihudiuüa kowi napiakah kownkow mang kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi mün khowt chow Haman nape tangka kown mih laikham paw Hathak kowi aia krawi lawp pe bowk khai. <verse eid="EST 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 4:8" />Jihudiuüa kowi nasaita kownkow Susa marow kri kowi mang lawtah mih ana pek chasak Hathak kowi Mawrdekai peah aram khai. Naiawng aia peah mih dow Esther pacham khi lah, now nami auan pacham tuk lah pakowh chekhai. Now aia maru-uüa nakala lawngra kownkow mang tut-e Esther nakowlü kown mih lawnguan paw Mawrdekai mih Hathak kowi krawi tek pe khai. <verse eid="EST 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 4:9" />Now Hathak dow uang plan hanow Mawrdekai krawi tek pe mih srui Esther kowi uang tek pe khai.<verse eid="EST 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 4:10" />Nakhowk khe Esther dow Hathak kowi mih Mawrdekai tut-e kowchinah hanow maiawng kowpe tekah khai: <verse eid="EST 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 4:11" />“Kachakuüa lah, masiuüa lah mang hawah dowi matchang mang hown nakowtakrum kownkow mang kim lak kowi kowkup mih maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown mih ari uowi. Nami ari dow mang kowh maru iukuüa hai pren powng kowi kowh maru maten tuk bowk chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh kuh raitua che lowra mih maru luk kowi iaw khai hanow nami maru kowi dow nakowngta kown nadowi. Tawkche kowi ala khowk chepaw mang haw ang dowi tak,” pakhai. <verse eid="EST 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 4:12" />Now Hathak dow naiawng Esther krawi tek pe mih laiklow maten Mawrdekai kowi kowtek pe khai bowt.<verse eid="EST 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 4:13" />Nakhowk khe Mawrdekai krawi tek pe Esther mih, “Mang kim kowi en uowi pache Jihudiuüa pungmadawng kowi en lowk ia naplai kown mih hangkow tuak diah. <verse eid="EST 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 4:14" />Maiawng mih khin khe che ririmma en uowi hanow akeng kowi kowh Jihudiuüa plai khai chepaw en hai en pa krungchakuüa dow nakowng kown towbowt. Maiawng mih khin uang ting kown mih rakowi chow en ka masiuüa mangra mih amia chow tuk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 4:15" />Nakhowk khe Mawrdekai kowi Esther krawi klangah mih, <verse eid="EST 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 4:16" />“En mih Susa marow kri kowi kowkowiah now nakowi kowh Jihudiuüa kowi arasang kuaah diah, now ang vüi kowi khang hawm büa diah. Enni mih sum ni sum uar mowr tawngpaw hang cha hang kham büa diah. Enni khang hawm mih iawng ang hai ang kowh narmauüa paw nakhang hawm kown. Nami kung kowi dow ari aiang iawng nadowi chepaw mang tut-e ang kowkowi sow. Nami kowi kowng takla khai chepaw ang nakowng sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 4:17" />Nahanow Mawrdekai dow nami hownia powt hanow Esther ana pek maten iawng kowchang khai bowt.<verse eid="EST 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EST 5" />
  <para style="s">Esther kowh sangkrangra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 5:1" />Sum ni mowr hawm khang prasi lük ki sun kung kowi auai ni dow Esther mih mang tawnguat khupla hanow mang kowh towklak pur kowi alak kowi kowh viadawng kowi kowiowng khai bowt. Nakhowk khe mang dow aia kowh towklak plawt prakowi dang se mang chowm rah kowi chowm phülü khai. <verse eid="EST 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 5:2" />Aia dow aia kowh towklak pur kowi kowh viadawng kowi Esther uang iowng dawnglawng mih khita now Esther luk kowi awmrawm kowh aia rut kowi kowh kuh raitua Esther prakowi haiiaw pe khai. Nakhowk khe Esther dow mang prakowi kowkowi hanow nami kuh raitua chem kowi kowdowk khai.<verse eid="EST 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 5:3" />Nakhowk khe Esther kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Esther, en tek kown mih uowi bow? Tawng chow en nau mih uowi? En che nau hanow ang kowh pren dawnglang paw ang nape en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 5:4" />Esther klangah mih, “Mangkri, en vüi amülüng mih chakkham ang kamrütta hüah. En che sak-ih ang khai hanow sakrauma hown ani dow Haman enchi ang kim kowi uang tawi cha hawm iüa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EST 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 5:5" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh naruüa kowi mang peah ana mih, “Esther tek iawng lup nachowngla kownkow kawmat Haman kowi uang hawla dit,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 5:5">Nahanow mang hai Haman iüah dow Esther kim kowi tawi cha hawm khai bowt. <verse eid="EST 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 5:6" />Now khamla grep tui se Esther kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow en nau mih uowi? En nau mih ang nape en kown. Ang kowh pren dawnglang en lü ang chepaw ang nape en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 5:7" />Nakhowk khe mang kowi Esther klangah mih, “Ang lü kown mih hai ang nau mih dow maiawng: <verse eid="EST 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 5:8" />En che ang luk kowi sak-ih hai ang nau mih pe ang kown nau khai hanow tharau paw Haman enchi ang kim kowi uang tawi cha hawm iüah iawk diah. Nakhowk khe ang nau mih chap ang tek en sow,” pape khai.<verse eid="EST 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mawrdekai kowi saita kownkow Haman kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 5:9" />Nami ni dow Haman mih kow sowrma hai awmrawmma powt khai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow mang kim tapplawt re-e khita Mawrdekai hanow lainowmma kunmarau khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Mawrdekai dow aia kowi khi chepaw iowng dowi chekhai, now tawng iawng paw aia kowi ringkaw mih krang tüng pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 5:10" />Nachenganchepaw nakow ni dow Haman mih town sak hanow aia kim kowi kowpowt khai. Now kim kowi kowting khe aia dow a-auiuauüa hai amasi Zeres kowi aia re-e hawah khai. <verse eid="EST 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 5:11" />Nakhowk khe aia dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan uowi mih lawnguan, aia kowh chapauüa kawm mih lawnguan, aia kowi tawng iawng ngai chow mang tüng pe ringkawra mih lawnguan, maru iukuüa hai akeng mih maru maten lak-e lang kri mih rah aia kowi mang peah mih lawnguan bawrima hown kowbüah kowi lawp pe khai. <verse eid="EST 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 5:12" />Nami klen kowi paw kowbüah kowi Haman tek pe mih, “Naiawngün krowngchow nak dowi tak; mang kowh masi Esther paw mang hown taiua cha hawm kownkow ang klen kowi mia kowi paw hawla dowi chekhai. Tharau paw mang hown taiua cha hawm kownkow aia kim kowi mang masi Esther haw angching iawk. <verse eid="EST 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 5:13" />Nachenganchepaw mang kim tapplawt re-e Jihudi chenchap Mawrdekai kowi chowm phulu mih ang khita hanow mapaw ang kowh sak <char style="w">thaulang</char> dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 5:14" />Nakhowk khe Haman kowi a-auiuauüa hai amasi Zeres tek pe mih, “Naiawng chekhai hanow Mawrdekai kowi naawkla kownkow aklang 50 muk mih singh phükta hüah lowk bowt. Tharau rau-e khe mangkri tut-e lü ana hanow Mawrdekai kowi nami singh kowi awkah bowt. Nami kung kowi dow awmrawmma hown mangkri enchi mang Esther kim kowi ka tarü hawm chak kown towbowt,” pape khai. Nami laiklow dow Haman mih nauta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Mawrdekai awk müa kamrütta singh lowk khai.<verse eid="EST 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EST 6" />
  <para style="s">Mawrdekai ka ringkawra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 6:1" />Nami iak dow mang Ahasuer mih mapaw tamüi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia mih aia uown chowm mang hownia aia pren lawnguan kowi kowh arui uowi mih bowih nauang pawla kownkow maru lowk ia kowi peah ana khai, now nami bowih mih aia kowi phat pe khai. <verse eid="EST 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 6:2" />Nakhowk khe mang Ahasuer kowi nasaita kownkow mang kowh kim tapplawt chawng mih akletia Bigthana hai akletia Teres iüah sangkrang mih mang kowi Mawrdekai phowk pe mih lawnguan nami bowih kowi ka phat khai.<verse eid="EST 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 6:3" />Nami ka phatta now anar kowi mang lüntaah mih, “Naiawng chang mih sung Mawrdekai kowi tawng iawng mih awmrawm sung chow peah? Aia kowi tawng iawng ngai khowk chow tüng pe ringkawra?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:3">Nakhowk khe anaruüa tek pe mih, “Tawngpaw peah dowi, now tawng iawng mih ringkawra paw tüng pe dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 6:4" />Now mang tek mih, “Kawmat mang kim kowi mia chow uowi?” pakhai. Nami khin khe Haman mih Mawrdekai kowi awkah kownkow aia phükta singh hüah mih laiklow mang kowi natek pe kownkow viadawng kowi uang khai.<verse eid="EST 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 6:5" />Mang kowi anaruüa klangah mih, “Viadawng kowi Haman uowi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:5">Now mang tek pe mih, “Ang kim lak kowi Haman pauang kup lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EST 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 6:6" />Now kim lak kowi Haman kowkup khe mang hawt lüntaah mih, “Mang natüng pe ringkawra kown mih maru kowi tawng iawng ngai chow changah e iung kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:6">Nakhowk khe Haman ka tuak mih, “Mang natüng pe ringkawra kown mih maru dow ang klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="EST 6:7-8" />Naiawng rakowi Haman tek pe mang mih, “Mangkri natüng pe ringkawra kown nau mih maru vüi mangkri kowh mang tawnguat pauang pawla pe lah, now mang lukruk paw pauang pawla pe lah, now mang kowh kawrnga paw pauang pawla pe lowk lah. <verse eid="EST 6:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 6:9" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün mih mang kowh maru lang iuk mih lowk ia kowi pacham ap pe lah. Now mang natüng pe ringkawra kown nau mih maru kowi nami tawnguat pacham khup pe lah, now nami kawrnga luk kowi pacham pe chowmah lah. Nami kung kowi dow nami maru pur kowi nami maru iuk mih narik mang hanow marow kowi krawi len kown. Now mang se mang se nami maru iuk mih, ‘Mang natüng pe ringkawra kown nau mih maru kowi dow maiawng nachangah kown,’ pahai pacham tekla lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EST 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 6:10" />Nakhowk khe Haman kowi mang peah ana mih, “Mang tawnguat hai kawrnga kawmat mat kowpaw hanow en tekah iawng mang kim tapplawt kowi kowh chowm mih Jihudi chenchap Mawrdekai luk kowi kowchang diah. En tekah mih maten kowi lowkchow paw tabat dowi iawng kowchang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 6:11" />Naiawng rakowi Haman dow mang tawnguat hai kawrnga mih kowpaw khai bowt. Now aia dow Mawrdekai kowi khup pe mang tawnguat hanow kawrnga luk kowi pe chowmah khai. Nami kung kowi dow marow dawnglang kowi Mawrdekai kowi krawi lenla se Haman tek mih, “Mang natüng pe ringkawra kown nau mih maru kowi dow maiawng nachangah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 6:12" />Nami kung kowi Mawrdekai dow mang kim tapplawt kowi kowplan khai iawk. Nachenganchepaw Haman dow tawmpa kunmarau hai rukrai hown mumla lumowr hanow alenma aia kim kowi kowpowt khai. <verse eid="EST 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 6:13" />Now aia luk kowi tawng iawng ngai chow uang phaw mih maten amasi Zeres hai a-auiuauüa kowi Haman tek pe khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 6:13">Nakhowk khe amasi hai aia kowh prengia pek miuüa tek pe mih, “Naiawng en kowh ringkawra piak mih Mawrdekai che Jihudi chenchap chekhai hanow aia kowi en ia kingküa dowi tham; en napiak ngengche kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 6:14" />Naiawng Haman hown kowbüah tatek reng tak khe mang kowh maru iukuüa mih uangah hanow Esther kim kowi mang hown natawi cha hawm kownkow Haman kowi alenma pawla khai.<verse eid="EST 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EST 7" />
  <para style="s">Haman kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 7:1" />Now mang Ahasuer hai Haman iüah dow masiuüa mang Esther kamrüt pe mih chakkham nakowtaiua cha kownkow kowkowi khai iawk. <verse eid="EST 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 7:2" />Esther tut-e naiawng amatchi kowtaiua cha chakkham mih dow pre leng khowk chekhai. Now amatchi kham grep tui mih khin khe mang plan lüntaah mih, “Esther, tawng chow en nau mih tek madiah? En nau mih ang nape en kown. Ang tut-e tawng chow en nalü kown mih uowi? Ang kowh pren dawnglang en lü khowm padow ang nape kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 7:3" />Esther klangah mih, “Mangkri, en che saksing sana ang hai ang lüah mih sak-ih ang khai hanow ang hai ang chenchap maru-uüa anging kowi lawng anging diah. <verse eid="EST 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 7:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang hai ang chenchap maru-uüa kowi nasaita anging kownkow cham sumta anging khai bowt. Maru nachangla nar kownkow cham sum anging mih e dow tawngpaw ang lai dowi tham diah. Tawkche anging kowi mih asaima nachumta anging kownkow cham sum anging mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EST 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 7:5" />Nakhowk khe Esther kowi mang Ahasuer lüntaah mih, “Mia chow nami maru? Tawng kowi chow aia? Naiawng mih lup nachang kown mih mia chow khowt pat sakkraing khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 7:6" />Esther klangah mih, “Nami maru ngak dow Haman chowbowt. Anging kowh ransu hai kingküa anging mih dow aia chowbowt,” pape khai. Nahanow Haman dow mang hai Esther iüah kowi lainowmma kramah khai bowt. <verse eid="EST 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 7:7" />Now mang dow kunmarau kowh towla grep tui hanow rü iawt khai, now bakan kowi kowkowi khai. Now Haman dow aia kowi mang nasaiah kown towbowt mih tuk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi Esther nalawngah kown mih lawnguan natek pe kownkow aia ta uowi khai.<verse eid="EST 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 7:8" />Haman dow aia kowi Esther nasanaah kown mih lawnguan kowtek pe kownkow Esther tut-e kowkowi khai. Nakhowk khe Esther dow chowm rah kowi hawt tanai phülü khai. Nami khita hanow Haman dow Esther khawk re-e kowtabawk krawm khai. Now nami dow bakan hownia kim kowi mangkri uang kup hown krowksang uang khita khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Nakhowk khe hek se mangkri tek mih, “Ang kim kowi hai ang pur kowi khowm padow masiuüa mang kowi nami maru napiak pe siri kown mih bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:8">Naiawng mangkri tek hown krowksang aia kowh maru-uüa dow Haman kowi uang mumta pe lu klum khai. <verse eid="EST 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 7:9" />Nakhowk khe akletia Harbona tek mih, “Haman kowh kim talang kowi aklang 50 muk mih singh phükta hüah mih uowi lowk. Nami dow mangkri kowh sak lawng pe mih Mawrdekai vüi Haman thawpah mih chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EST 7:9">Now mangkri lawt ana mih, “Nami singh kowi Haman kowi kowawkah diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EST 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 7:10" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow Haman kowi mih Mawrdekai vüi kowi kowh aia thawpah mih singh kowi kowawkah büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow mangkri kowh kunmarau mih prowng khai bowt.<verse eid="EST 7:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EST 8" />
  <para style="s">Jihudiuüa kowi Esther lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 8:1" />Nami ni khe mang Ahasuer dow Jihudiuüa kowh ransu Haman kowh dawngthawnguan maten masiuüa mang Esther kowi peta bowk khai. Now Esther dow Mawrdekai mih aia kowh rakma tawng pami mang kowi tek pe khai bowt. Nami hownia bowt now Mawrdekai mih mang pur kowi nowng uang khai bowt. <verse eid="EST 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 8:2" />Mang dow aia kowh mur uowi mih rutbüt aia rut hownia klüpah hanow Mawrdekai kowi peah khai. Nami rutbüt dow Haman kowi peah akat kowh mangkri plan pawta pe mih chekhai. Now Esther dow Mawrdekai kowi mih Haman kowh dawngthawnguan naming nakhet kown mih kurdik peah khai.<verse eid="EST 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 8:3" />Nami kung kowi dow Esther mih mangkri hown uang plan talawp khai iawk. Aia dow mang kowi dowk pe khawk hanow uang kar khai. Now Jihudiuüa kowi nasaita kownkow Agag chenchap Haman kowh angakma mih kamrütra nataingta kown mih mangkri kowi aia tek pe khai. <verse eid="EST 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 8:4" />Nakhowk khe mangkri dow aia kowh kuh raitua mih Esther prakowi iu iaw pe khai, now Esther awr rü hanow mangkri pur kowi iowng khai.<verse eid="EST 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 8:5" />Esther tek pe mih, “Mangkri, en che nauta khai, en che saksing sana ang khai, lup iungma pahai en che ka tuak khai, now en che sak-ih ang khai hanow Jihudiuüa kowi nasai dowi kownkow en pren kowi kowh pren powng maten kowi krawi lawt ana lowk diah. Jihudiuüa maten kowi nasaita kownkow Agag chenchap Hamedatha kowh chapa Haman krawi sakta cha mih iawng nachang dowi kownkow krawi phuang diah. <verse eid="EST 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 8:6" />Ang matia chenchap hai ang matia maru-uüa luk kowi piakra nauang ting kown mih tawng iawng chow ang namüta hüah kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EST 8:7" />Nahanow masiuüa mang Esther hai Jihudi chenchap Mawrdekai iüah kowi mang Ahasuer tek pe mih, “Haman dow Jihudiuüa kowi nasaita kown mih kamrüt khai. Naiawng rakowi ang ana hown maru kawmuüa dow aia kowi mih singh hown awkta khowk. Now aia kowh dawngthawnguan dow Esther kowi ang peta khowk. <verse eid="EST 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EST 8:8" />Enni Jihudiuüa kowi nalawngla kownkow enchi nau iawng ang ming hown plan rui chasak iüah aram diah, now nami chasak kowi kowh ana mih nowng klowila dowi kownkow mang kowh ming uowi mih rutbüt hown tuk pe mur diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang ming hai mang rutbüt hown tukta mur mih ana pek dow nowng klowi dowi bowt chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EST 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EST 8:9" />Naiawng rakowi sum la mih Sivan la 23 ni khe Mawrdekai dow mang kowh cha rui miuüa kowi kuaah khai, now Mawrdekai tek iawng amatni dow rui chasak lowk khai. Nami chasak dow Jihudiuüa maten, pren kruitown miuüa, maru iukuüa, now India pren hownia Ethiawpia pren mowr mih pren powng 127 klüng kowi kowh maru iukuüa maten tut-e krawi sak pe büah khai. Naiawng cha rui miuüa krawi sak cha mih dow pren powng towng kowi kowh chowlowkkow maru-uüa kowh cha hai chowlowkkow chenchap lai hown chekhai. Now Jihudiuüa kowi paw amatni kowh chenchap cha hai lai hown krawi sak pe büah khai. <verse eid="EST 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EST 8:10" />Cha rui miuüa dow mang Ahasuer ming hown rui chasak khai, now nami chasak kowi mang ming uowi mih rutbüt hown Mawrdekai tuk pe mur khai. Now naiawngün chasak dow mang kowh iowm lang len mih kawrnga sangrum hown satang phowng miuüa kowi Mawrdekai krawi pe saah khai.<verse eid="EST 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="EST 8:11-12" />Mang Ahasuer kowh nami chasak kowi dow laipre la mih Adar la kowi laisum ni khe marow towng hai pren powng maten kowi kowh Jihudiuüa mih arasang nataiua uowi hanow kowmatia kowi naia towkala kown mih alow arui uowi chekhai. Now amatni Jihudiuüa hai amatni kowh masi chauüa kowi akeng chenchapuüa hai akeng mih pren powng kowi kowh maru-uüa uang sen miuüa kowi asaima amatni nahawt ia saita kown mih alow paw uowi chekhai. Nami klen kowi naiawngün ransu-uüa kowh dawngthawnguan amatni naia paw kown mih alow paw uowi chekhai.<verse eid="EST 8:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 8:13" />Mang kowh ana dow rirow iawng pren powng maten kowi nakrawi phuang kown mih hai maru maten kowi nakrawi pe tuk pe taah kown mih laiklow uowi chekhai. Maru kawmuüa kowi naiawng krawi tek pe mih dow ransu-uüa kowi naia sat pe klai kownkow akhin khe Jihudiuüa mih kamrütiama naia uowila kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="EST 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 8:14" />Naiawng mang peah ana rakowi satang phowng miuüa dow mang kowh iowm lang len mih kawrnga hown cham tarü büah khai bowt. Nami chasak kowi kowh ana dow Susa marow kri kowi paw phuangla khai.<verse eid="EST 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 8:15" />Nami kung kowi Mawrdekai dow mangkri pur hownia lawt khai bowt. Nakhowk khe aia dow aruachow hai akawchow mih mang tawnguat khupma chekhai, now nami luk kowi dow arikchow panow adipükchow mih la hown kowh kowrmow khup pe khai. Aia dow kuh hown kowh aiukma mih mang lukruk krukma chekhai. Susa marowchakuüa dow chasak kowi kowh rirow sar tata hanow how sawmlawm se piaw büah khai. <verse eid="EST 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 8:16" />Jihudiuüa dow lainowmma piaw büah pabüah khai, now ka ringkawra büah khai. <verse eid="EST 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 8:17" />Mang kowh ana krawi ting mih pren maten hai marow towng kowi kowh Jihudiuüa dow piaw büah rakowi chang pawi büah khai. Now akeng chenchap hownia tawngbak mih maru-uüa dow tawi owm Jihudi kawngmu hanow tawi kham Jihudi chenchap ne khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow akeng chenchap maru-uüa dow amatni kowi Jihudiuüa changah kown mih kowi kram büah khai bowt.<verse eid="EST 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EST 9" />
  <para style="s">Jihudiuüa sai ransu-uüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 9:1" />Now mang kowh ana pek iawng nachang kown mih khin Adar la laisum ni mih dow uang ting khai bowt. Nami ni khe ransu-uüa dow Jihudiuüa kowi nowng senta kown mih sakowmma chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw ransu-uüa tuakta iawng phaw dowi kowi amatni kowi mih Jihudiuüa plan nowng senta ian. <verse eid="EST 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 9:2" />Amatni kowi kowh senah kown nau miuüa kowi nasenah kownkow Jihudiuüa dow mang Ahasuer pren kowi kowh pren powng maten kowi amatni chowlowkkow marow kowi takua talawm büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow akeng chenchapuüa kramah kowh uang senah khe sum reng chekhai. <verse eid="EST 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 9:3" />Now pren powng maten kowi kowh maru iukuüa, pren kruitown miuüa hai mang kowh akeng mih maru iukuüa dow Mawrdekai kowi kram kowh Jihudiuüa kowi tawi khowngah khai. <verse eid="EST 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EST 9:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Mawrdekai dow mang kim kowi kowh lang kri mih chekhai. Aia kowh ming iung nang iung dow pren powng maten kowi cham krawi tahowng khai. Naiawng hai aia dow pani kowh pani uang kür ngamlam khai.<verse eid="EST 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EST 9:5" />Jihudiuüa dow amatni kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi saidawng hown krawi saita bowk khai, now amatni kowi kowh suiah miuüa kowi paw nau iawng changah büah khai. <verse eid="EST 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EST 9:6" />Jihudiuüa dow Susa marow kri kowi nget maru iun 500 ia kowi saita khai. <verse eid="EST 9:6" /><verse number="7-10" style="v" sid="EST 9:7-10" />Naiawngün pungmadawng kowi amatni kowh ransu Haman kowh chapa hamüt ia kowi paw saila büah khai. Naiawngünuüa dow Parsandatha, Dalfawn, Aspatha, Poratha, Adalia, Aridatha, Parmasta, Arisai, Aridai hai Vaizatha büah chekhai. Tawkche amatni dow tawng iawng mih uanh paw pawla büah dowi chekhai <verse eid="EST 9:7-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EST 9:11" />Now Susa marow kri kowi kowh saita mih maru iun mut dow nami ni khe mang kowi uang tek pe khai. <verse eid="EST 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EST 9:12" />Nakhowk khe masiuüa mang Esther kowi mang tek pe mih, “Susa marow kri kowi Jihudiuüa saita maru 500 ia khowk, now Haman kowh chapa hamüt ia kowi paw saila khowk. Makowi che naiawng khowt saita khowk now pren powng kowi khowm mün ia khowk chow saita mih amia chow tuk? Kawmat tawng chow en nau tak? En nau mih ang nape en kown” pape khai.<verse eid="EST 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EST 9:13" />Now Esther klangah mih, “Mangkri, en che sak-ih khai hanow Susa marow kri kowi ani kowh Jihudiuüa chang iawng tharau paw nachang iawk kown mih alow peah diah, now Haman kowh chapa hamüt ia kowi phükta hüah mih singh kowi pacham tarta hüah lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EST 9:14" />Now mangkri dow naiawng nachang kown mih lawt ana khai, now mang kowh ana dow Susa marow kri kowi krawi phuang khai. Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa dow Haman kowh chapa hamüt ia kowi phükta hüah mih singh kowi tarah büah khai. <verse eid="EST 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EST 9:15" />Nami kung kowi paw Jihudiuüa mih Adar la laitali ni mih ni khe Susa marow kri kowi uang takua talawm büah hanow sai maru 300 ia khai iawk. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow tawng iawng mih uanh paw pawla büah dowi iawk chekhai.<verse eid="EST 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EST 9:16" />Nami khin khe mang kowh pren powng kowi kowh akeng mih Jihudiuüa maten paw amatni kowh ransu-uüa rut hownia kowmatia kowi natowkala kownkow arasang takua talawm büah khai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow ransu-uüa 75,000 ia kowi saita khai. Tawkche tawng iawng mih uanh paw pawla büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EST 9:17" />Naiawngün phaw mih dow Adar la laisum ni khe chekhai, now laitali ni mih ni khe dow tanai büah khai. Nami ni dow chang pawi hanow piaw büah pabüah khai. <verse eid="EST 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EST 9:18" />Tawkche Susa marow kri kowi kowh Jihudiuüa dow Adar la laisum ni hai laitali ni mih ni khe paw sai maru reng tak chekhai, now laitanga ni mih ni khe dow tanai büah khai. Nami ni dow chang pawi hanow piaw büah khai. <verse eid="EST 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EST 9:19" />Naiawng rakowi ani mowr pat kua kowi kowh uowi mih Jihudiuüa dow Adar la laitali ni mih ni khe chang pawi hanow piaw büah pabüah reng khai, now lowkkowlowk kim kowi tasa chakkham büah reng khai.<verse eid="EST 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jihudiuüa sun Purim pawi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EST 9:20" />Mawrdekai dow naiawngün phaw mih lawnguan maten ruiah khai, now mang Ahasuer pren kowi kowh atawnchow hai alakma kowi kowh uowi mih Jihudiuüa kowi krawi sak pe chasak khai. <verse eid="EST 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EST 9:21" />Now Jihudiuüa kowi dow ning towng Adar la kowi kowh laitali hai laitanga ni khe nasun pawi büah reng kownkow aia krawi peah ana khai. <verse eid="EST 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EST 9:22" />Jihudiuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Nami ni dow chang pawi hanow apiaw apama enni nasunah kown, now lowkkowlowk kim kowi enni tasa chakkham kown. Nami klen kowi ngarawng ngaraima miuüa kowi enni nape awmrawm sung kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow a-i kowh ransu-uüa rut hownia a-i ia plai mih dow nami pre ni khe chekhai, now kar ngukra hai taprüa taiiara takcha awmrawmra hai piawra uang ting mih dow nami la kowi chowtaih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EST 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EST 9:23" />Naiawng rakowi Jihudiuüa dow Mawrdekai krawi rui pe ana mih iawng chang kown mih nauta khai. Amatni dow nami pre ni nachang pawi kown mih nauta khai <verse eid="EST 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EST 9:24" />Agag krungchak Hamedatha chapa Haman dow Jihudiuüa kowh ransu chekhai, aia dow Jihudi chenchapuüa kowi nasaita bowk kownkow sangkrang khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kuak plang<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Plang </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow Persia lai hown Pur chekhai. </char></note> khai. <verse eid="EST 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EST 9:25" />Nachenganchepaw Esther dow mang tut-e uangah hanow Jihudiuüa kowi Haman kingküaah mih lawnguan tek pe khai, now mang dow Jihudiuüa kowi Haman nasaiah kownkow sangkrang mih takcha kowi Haman luk kowi nami ripra napeah kownkow lawt ana khai. Nahanow Haman hai achapauüa kowi mih singh kowi tarta hüah khai. <verse eid="EST 9:25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="EST 9:26-27" />Naiawng rakowi nami pawi ming dow Pur pami hownia Purim pahai rükah khai. Mawrdekai krawi peta ana mih rakowi hai Jihudiuüa luk kowi naiawng uang phaw mih rakowi Jihudiuüa dow amatni vüi thawp ri lowk khai. Nami ri dow amatni, amatni kowh krungchakuüa hai tawi chowng Jihudi miuüa maten Mawrdekai kowh ana pek iawng khowm bowkta mih khin kowi ning towng nami pre ni chi nachang pawi ngengche kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="EST 9:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EST 9:28" />Nami pawi pre ni mih dow ning towng pren powng towng, marow towng, kimchak towng chowngchowng saksakma natukah reng kown, now nasunah reng kown. Nahanow Jihudiuüa pungmadawng kowi nami pre ni mih <char style="w">Purim pawi</char> sun katpaw nataing kown nadowi bowt, now amatni krungchakuüa sak hownia nami laiklow mih natama kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="EST 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EST 9:29" />Nami kung kowi Abihail chama masiuüa mang Esther hai Jihudi chenchap Mawrdekai dow Purim pawi pami ari anikma nachang kownkow ana khawtma hown plan ta rui chasak lowk khai iawk. <verse eid="EST 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EST 9:30" />Now Mawrdekai dow taking tasangra hai thaulangra laiklow mih mang Ahasuer kowh 127 klüng mih pren powng kowi kowh Jihudiuüa tut-e chasak hown krawi sa khai. <verse eid="EST 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EST 9:31" />Naiawng aia krawi sak cha mih dow Mawrdekai hai Esther iüah kowh alow pek iawng khowmta bowkta mih ni khe Purim pawi pre ni naia sunla kownkow chekhai. Amatni vüi hai amatni krungchakuüa tawng khe chow nasun hawm khang kown mih hai taprüa tanguk kown mih sangkrang büah khai. Nami iawng nami pawi paw naia sunla kownkow sangkrang büah khai. <verse eid="EST 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EST 9:32" />Now nami Purim pawi ri dow Esther kowh ana hown anikma thawpah büah khai, now nami dow ruiah khai.<verse eid="EST 9:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EST 10" />
  <para style="s">Mawrdekai ka ringkawra ngamlam mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EST 10:1" />Mang Ahasuer dow aia pren kowi kowh maru maten hai alakma mih süngdum kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten kowi nape mangmu kownkow lawt ana khai. <verse eid="EST 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EST 10:2" />Mang kowh kürra hai nowng changra lawnguan dow Media pren hai Persia pren kowi kowh Manguüa Lawnguan pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. Now Mawrdekai kowi mang peah maru iukra kowh Mawrdekai ka ringkawra ngamlam mih lawnguan paw nami bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. <verse eid="EST 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EST 10:3" />Jihudi chenchap Mawrdekai kowh arah dow mang Ahasuer dakchow taih chekhai. Aia dow Jihudi chenchap pungmadawng kowi uang kri kraing khai, now aia kowi dow maru ringkawah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aia chenchapuüa iung müa hai <char style="w">thaulang</char> müa kowi chang lup reng chekhai.<verse eid="EST 10:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EST 10" />
</usx>